Rules

3) Take note of the things we talk about, and make sure to track them on the file 'notes.txt'. This way i can keep track of the challenges i encounter and use it for content generation.
4) Before taking notes, see if is worth to take note about it.
5) Notes should be about the journey, the challenges, the problems, the solutions, the learnings, etc.
6) Before you take notes, think if you need to update the 'notes.txt' file.
9) If you are not sure about something, ask me for clarification.
10) If you are not sure about the answer to a question, say 'I dont know' and ask me for help.
11) In the 'notes.txt', provide suggestions for tweets, blog posts, etc. This should be done in the last section of the file.
12) Along with the suggestions, provide a brief explanation of the content you are suggesting. For each content suggestion, provide a title, a brief description, and a list of topics that should be covered in the content. 
13) Dont forget the brief explanation for each content suggestion on the 'notes.txt' file.